an data-lake-id=\"ua3258cd6\" id=\"ua3258cd6\">如果想定义的张量能够自动计算梯度,那么我们就需要将参数requires_grad置为True</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u6329b21d\" id=\"u6329b21d\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22torch.tensor(%5B5.5%2C%203%5D%2C%20requires_grad%3DTrue)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cc015af7%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ue5435131\" id=\"ue5435131\"><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"99c9d30e\" id=\"99c9d30e\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucd3ebe0d\" id=\"ucd3ebe0d\">张量的运算</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ub193dc7c\" id=\"ub193dc7c\"><br></p><ol list=\"u52a85e51\"><li fid=\"u29d53b5b\" data-lake-id=\"u8245c593\" id=\"u8245c593\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3eb4cc03\" id=\"u3eb4cc03\">加法</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"uc25b9ac9\" id=\"uc25b9ac9\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x%20%3D%20torch.rand(2%2C%202)%5Cny%20%3D%20torch.rand(2%2C%202)%5Cnz%20%3D%20x%20%2B%20y%5Cnprint(z)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%2250582a16%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u7236b48d\" id=\"u7236b48d\"><br></p><ol list=\"uefbc8101\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"u2a108378\" data-lake-id=\"u53240903\" id=\"u53240903\"><span data-lake-id=\"uce26e58f\" id=\"uce26e58f\">减法</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u7d50cf3d\" id=\"u7d50cf3d\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22z%20%3D%20x%20-%20y%5Cnprint(z)%5Cnz%20%3D%20torch.sub(x%2Cy)%5Cnprint(z)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%2217005a44%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u39f5b25b\" id=\"u39f5b25b\"><br></p><ol list=\"ucb4123f9\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"ubaa19dcb\" data-lake-id=\"u0fa3be4e\" id=\"u0fa3be4e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1caba6df\" id=\"u1caba6df\">乘法</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"ue283db01\" id=\"ue283db01\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22z%20%3D%20x%20*%20y%5Cnprint(z)%5Cnz%20%3D%20torch.mul(x%2C%20y)%5Cnprint(z)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%2276de31de%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u7ae7eda7\" id=\"u7ae7eda7\"><br></p><ol list=\"uaacb2587\" start=\"4\"><li fid=\"u55def1b0\" data-lake-id=\"u52acaa92\" id=\"u52acaa92\"><span data-lake-id=\"udc204a8e\" id=\"udc204a8e\">除法</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u4a855e95\" id=\"u4a855e95\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22z%20%3D%20x%20%2F%20y%5Cnprint(z)%5Cnz%20%3D%20torch.div(x%2C%20y)%5Cnprint(z)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22279befd0%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ud319b52b\" id=\"ud319b52b\"><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"b3753c07\" id=\"b3753c07\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7385efe7\" id=\"u7385efe7\">张量的切片</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u90b192bb\" id=\"u90b192bb\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x%20%3D%20torch.rand(5%2C3)%5Cnprint(x)%5Cnprint(x%5B1%2C%201%5D)%5Cnprint(x%5B%3A%2C%200%5D)%5Cnprint(x%5B1%2C%20%3A%5D)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22d8304dc4%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uf774d715\" id=\"uf774d715\"><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"ae0f3ecb\" id=\"ae0f3ecb\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc6b8ae14\" id=\"uc6b8ae14\">张量的形变</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u41151e91\" id=\"u41151e91\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9651de86\" id=\"u9651de86\"><span data-lake-id=\"u31de715f\" id=\"u31de715f\">将原张量的形状进行变换,即元素总个数不变的情况下改变行数和列数, 使用torch.view(size)类似numpy.reshape</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u2cc9f182\" id=\"u2cc9f182\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x%20%3D%20torch.randn(4%2C%204)%5Cny%20%3D%20x.view(16)%5Cnz%20%3D%20x.view(2%2C%208)%5Cn%5Cnprint(x.size()%2C%20y.size()%2C%20z.size())%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22f53b5a26%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u8a38fa8d\" id=\"u8a38fa8d\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u73f69c10\" id=\"u73f69c10\"><span data-lake-id=\"u919af3d3\" id=\"u919af3d3\">例如x的形状为12 x 23 x 100, 而我们想把x转为2 x M 的大小时,我们就必须手动算出12 x 23 x 100 的值, 然后除以2, 进而得到M的值</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uea816431\" id=\"uea816431\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u5fe095e9\" id=\"u5fe095e9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9f15cca0\" id=\"u9f15cca0\">为了避免这种情况, 我们可以将M所在位置赋值为-1. 计算机看到-1时, 会自动使用12 x 23 x 100 / 2 的值来替换-1</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud10623ee\" id=\"ud10623ee\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x%20%3D%20torch.randn(12%2C13%2C100)%5Cny%20%3D%20x.view(2%2C-1)%5Cnprint(x.size()%2C%20y.size())%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%2242edc8b7%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ufb8c5cca\" id=\"ufb8c5cca\"><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"bfd2c93a\" id=\"bfd2c93a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u360291d6\" id=\"u360291d6\">Numpy与Tensor的互转</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u046ecfe8\" id=\"u046ecfe8\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u765c266b\" id=\"u765c266b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u207fa89d\" id=\"u207fa89d\">使用tensor.numpy() 将Tensor类型的变量转为Numpy类型:</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud7ec29de\" id=\"ud7ec29de\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22a%20%3D%20torch.ones(5)%5Cnprint(a)%5Cn%5Cnb%20%3D%20a.numpy()%5Cnprint(type(b))%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eba14a03%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ub78990ca\" id=\"ub78990ca\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf4cb62b2\" id=\"uf4cb62b2\"><span data-lake-id=\"uccb2742f\" id=\"uccb2742f\">使用torch.from_numpy() 将Numpy类型转为Tensor:</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc23e338a\" id=\"uc23e338a\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22import%20numpy%20as%20np%20%5Cna%20%3D%20np.ones(5)%5Cnb%20%3D%20torch.from_numpy(a)%5Cnprint(type(b))%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%2268e6caff%22%7D\"></card>",
